  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Human Rights Film Festival 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Human Rights Film Festival engages and genuinely connects those that do not traditionally find themselves in human rights spaces through film screenings and talanoa sessions that create a safe environment for the free exchange of ideas and opinions. The festival is therefore an opportunity to discuss topics that can sometimes be considered taboo/tabu allowing for the legitimate exploration of human rights challenges and progress for and alongside our Pacific region.</narrative>
  </description>
